{"unit_id":"huangxp12__dsh-recent-sessions#card-zh","repo":"huangxp12/dsh-recent-sessions","commit":"0b870a0726efbabd78d36c1f7425dae969e343cf","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-recent-sessions 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的会话管理插件，通过全局面板、侧栏入口、悬浮按钮和输入框待办条接入界面。它把不同工作目录中的会话集中显示，支持按时间分组、排序、筛选和搜索消息内容，也能查看最近提问、打开会话或复制和显示目录路径。用户可以为会话记下想法，在重新打开会话时查看并手动填入草稿。适合同时处理多个项目、需要找回旧会话或暂存后续问题的 DSH 用户。无需 API Key；想法和视图状态保存在浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:787-930","lib/client.js:1185-1278","lib/client.js:273-380"]}
{"unit_id":"huangxp12__dsh-recent-sessions#card-en","repo":"huangxp12/dsh-recent-sessions","commit":"0b870a0726efbabd78d36c1f7425dae969e343cf","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-recent-sessions is a DSH web plugin with a global session panel and thought dock. Browse and filter sessions across workspaces, search messages, preview prompts, reopen sessions, and reveal folders. Save a thought locally and insert it into a draft when you return. No API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:787-930","lib/client.js:1185-1278","lib/client.js:273-380"]}
